[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/28.tres]关键关系[/font][/b]


[indent]•  [color=#000000]曹操：[/color] 知己关系，赐名、赞腹心、兖州最危时唯他扛住。曹操对其谋反之告视而不见，反加厚待。[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]荀彧：[/color] 盟友。荀彧引荐、将程昱梦告曹操、共同留守兖州、共同劝迎天子，无记录冲突。[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]郭嘉：[/color] 共同劝阻放刘备，并列于陈寿评语中。[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]曹丕：[/color] 暮年师长型关系。辅曹丕处理降卒，善处父子之间，曹丕终为流涕。[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]邢贞：[/color] 冲突方。争威仪细节不可考，性格冲突（程昱刚戾、邢贞喜摆谱）为背景。[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


